00:01:43.960 --> 00:01:44.820
OK.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:48.710
What about 20%?

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.170
30%?

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:53.600
40%?

00:01:53.600 --> 00:01:54.100
Yeah.

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:58.571
So it turns out it's about 35%.

00:01:58.571 --> 00:02:00.820
Now, this particular stat
comes to us from Rightscale.

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:04.750
